==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[bit map]]
* [[bit-map]]

===Etymology===
{{compound|bit|map|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}
{{wikipedia|Raster graphics}}

# {{context|computing|lang=en}} A series of [[bit]]s that represents a [[rasterize]]d [[graphic]] [[image]], each [[pixel]] being represented as a group of bits.
#* '''2002''', André LaMothe, ''Tricks of the Windows Game Programming Gurus'' (page 315)
#*: Using the hardware blitter to move '''bitmaps''' from VRAM to VRAM is much faster than moving them from system memory to VRAM.

====Usage notes====
* See notes at {{term|pixmap|lang=en}}.

====Synonyms====
* [[pixmap]]

